+[![Build status](https://travis-ci.org/PolymerElements/iron-meta.svg?branch=master)](https://travis-ci.org/PolymerElements/iron-meta)
+
+_[Demo and API docs](https://elements.polymer-project.org/elements/iron-meta)_
